WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:07.241
Hi! I'm Ana. Let me tell you about me: places, dates and times!

2
00:00:08.691 --> 00:00:12.174
I live in Brazil, in Rio de Janeiro.

3
00:00:12.624 --> 00:00:14.621
It's a beautiful city!

4
00:00:16.871 --> 00:00:20.447
I live on Ocean Avenue, in Copacabana.

5
00:00:20.897 --> 00:00:25.216
My address? I live at 250 Ocean Avenue.

6
00:00:27.466 --> 00:00:30.856
I was born in 1998, in May.

7
00:00:31.306 --> 00:00:34.139
My birthday is on May 28th.

8
00:00:36.389 --> 00:00:39.314
On weekdays, I get up at six o'clock.

9
00:00:39.764 --> 00:00:42.040
I start work at nine a.m.

10
00:00:44.290 --> 00:00:48.284
I have English class on Mondays and Wednesdays.

11
00:00:48.734 --> 00:00:51.149
My class is at seven p.m.

12
00:00:53.399 --> 00:00:58.321
And today? Today is Saturday, and I'm at the beach!

13
00:00:58.771 --> 00:01:02.858
And you? Where do you live? When is your birthday?

